79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (The Community-Detection Platform is a web-based application designed to identify and connect people based on their common interests, activities, skills, and preferences. The platform allows users to create profiles, join communities, discover groups, share posts, and communicate with other members having similar interests. Unlike traditional social-media platforms, the main focus of this system is to help users find relevant communities and build meaningful connections. The system provides features such as user registration, login, profile management, community creation, community discovery, post sharing, commenting, liking, and member interaction. A community detection mechanism analyzes user interests and activities to suggest suitable communities. Administrators can manage users, communities, posts, and reported content through an admin dashboard.The platform can be developed using technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB. The proposed system provides a simple, scalable, and user-friendly environment for discovering and participating in online communities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
