/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (THE PROPOSED SYSTEM BEGINS WITH USER REGISTRATION AND PROFILE CREATION, WHERE USERS PROVIDE THEIR BASIC INFORMATION AND INTERESTS. THE SYSTEM COLLECTS INFORMATION SUCH AS USER INTERESTS, JOINED COMMUNITIES, POSTS, LIKES, COMMENTS, AND CONNECTIONS. THIS INFORMATION IS ANALYZED TO IDENTIFY SIMILARITIES BETWEEN USERS. A COMMUNITY-DETECTION TECHNIQUE SUCH AS LOUVAIN OR LABEL PROPAGATION CAN BE USED TO IDENTIFY GROUPS OF RELATED USERS. BASED ON THE DETECTED COMMUNITIES AND USER INTERESTS, THE SYSTEM RECOMMENDS SUITABLE COMMUNITIES. USERS CAN THEN JOIN COMMUNITIES, INTERACT WITH MEMBERS, SHARE CONTENT, AND PARTICIPATE IN DISCUSSIONS.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
